{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"fcdd2120da2c8f8b","type":"text","text":"## Investor Types\n\n[[L4 Investment Industry Participants.canvas]]\n\n\n\n","x":-240,"y":160,"width":240,"height":120},
		{"id":"eca891f840076a93","type":"text","text":"## Individual Investors\n\n**Trade** **securities** or **authorise others** to do so for their **personal accounts**.\n\n\n### Retail Investor\n\n* Individual with modest resources.\n* Normally provided with standardised cost effective services; online portals, call centres.\n\n### High net worth investors\n\n* Substantial investable assets.\n* Personalised attention, estate planning, separate accounts rather than pooled funds.\n\n---\n\n**Family Offices**: **Ultra high net worth investors** may employ professionals in a family office - a company **dedicated** to **managing** **financial**, **legal** and estate **affairs** for one or more **wealthy families**.\n\n**Regulators** **restrict** certain complex or **alternative** **investments** to **accredited investors*\n\n\n\n\n","x":-1160,"y":-630,"width":720,"height":650},
		{"id":"ddb65e35027b76e5","type":"text","text":"## Institutional Investors\n\nSome advance an organisational mission, some provide financial services to clients.\n\n### Pension Plans\n\nHold pension funds for retired members (beneficiaries)\n\n* **Defined Benefit** plans: **employer** promises specific payments and bears **investment risk** (may have to **top up** if investment fails)\n* **Defined Contribution** plans: **employee** bears **investment risk** and **chooses** from **approved funds**.\n\n#### Endowment Funds & Foundations\n\n**Long term funds** supporting **non-profits**. Must balance long term **capital growth** with **annual spending requirements**.\n\n#### Sovereign Wealth Funds\n\n**Invest** unspent tax revenues/**surplus** national wealth like **oil** revenue for benefit of future.\n\n#### Non-Financial Companies\n\nCorporations that produce products, services and **invest** **excess** operational cash. \n\n* **Short term** managed by corporate treasurers (short term **money market funds** etc)\n* **Long term** funds managed by **CFO**/**CIO** to finance **R&D**, **acquisitions** etc.\n\n#### Investment Companies\n\nSole purpose to hold investments on behalf of shareholders or unit holders via pooled investment vehicles\n\n* Mutual funds\n* Hedge funds\n* Private equity funds\n* Venture capital\n\n#### Insurance Companies\n\nMoney earned from clients invested as reserve funds to pay out future claims.\n\n* Property/Casualty Insurers need more liquid investments \n* Life Insurers need longer term assets, using asset/liability strategies\n\n","x":120,"y":-630,"width":1120,"height":1110},
		{"id":"bc1a87095b224879","type":"text","text":"## Portfolio Management Structure\n\n* **Internal Management** with **in house** team of investment **professionals**\n* **Outsourced Management** contracting **external** investment management **firms****/**consultants\n* **Mixed Model** managing core asset classes internally but outsourcing alternative investments to external experts","x":120,"y":800,"width":1040,"height":200},
		{"id":"f7c0f71e5b8b0aa5","type":"text","text":"","x":-41,"y":-456,"width":250,"height":60}
	],
